{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Gerrit had duplicate Stage A CLs 2690 and 2691 with the same Change-Id due the earlier HTTP 504 retry. After abandoning duplicate 2691, Gerrit still rejected patchset updates because abandoned duplicates count for Change-Id uniqueness. I am abandoning 2690 as well and recreating the same validated Stage A diff under a fresh Change-Id; no force/bypass is used."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788652498194124001,"uuid":"342ebe54-8629-482f-ae9d-767d79922275"}